00:02:22.986 --> 00:02:24.807
I feel like I'm just
gonna be in constant pain

00:02:24.807 --> 00:02:26.055
for the next two months.

00:02:26.055 --> 00:02:28.327
The first day that I did it, it was like

00:02:28.327 --> 00:02:30.750
I opened the portals to hell.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.083
Day one of yoga.

00:02:34.606 --> 00:02:36.439
My back hurts so much.

00:02:37.926 --> 00:02:38.955
Like, so much.

00:02:38.955 --> 00:02:42.470
And it was almost like the
exercise was picking open a scab.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.286
It was unveiling the
pain that was underneath.

00:02:46.286 --> 00:02:49.602
I have a bit of a hypochondria.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.180
And so, whenever something's
wrong with me, I'm like,

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:52.979
"Cancer, it's cancer, cancer."

00:02:52.979 --> 00:02:56.296
So I told my doctor
