help my lower back pain,

00:03:36.662 --> 00:03:39.005
though, in reality, my
friends just kind of turned it

00:03:39.005 --> 00:03:41.647
into a toy more than anything.

00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:42.480
Damn it.

00:03:45.742 --> 00:03:49.662
- [Man] Oh, burn, 'cause
Zach sucks at people, yeah.

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:51.919
- I still use that chair to this day.

00:03:51.919 --> 00:03:52.752
