00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.461
I mean, living hurt.

00:04:18.461 --> 00:04:19.894
I'm talking about, I would wake up

00:04:19.894 --> 00:04:21.965
in the middle of the night five times.

00:04:21.965 --> 00:04:25.195
All during this, I'm
working a full-time job,

00:04:25.195 --> 00:04:28.642
but when you're not sleeping,
it eats away at you mentally.

00:04:28.642 --> 00:04:30.325
I dreaded when the sun would set

00:04:30.325 --> 00:04:33.279
because I knew that my
pain was coming back.

00:04:33.279 --> 00:04:35.046
(groans)

00:04:35.046 --> 00:04:36.854
Now, throughout this process,

00:04:36.854 --> 00:04:39.588
I told my doctor, told my chiropractor,

00:04:39.588 --> 00:04:43.057
we had this kind of false
diagnosis of the scoliosis,

00:04:43.057 --> 00:04:45.909
but the scoliosis does not explain

00:04:45.909 --> 00:04:47.284
the pain that I was going through.

00:04:47.284 --> 00:04:48.624
I mean, not even close.

00:04:48.624 --> 00:04:50.719
The amount that I had,
I mean, it's like, boop.

00:04:50.719 --> 00:04:52.476
It's nothing.

00:04:52.476 --> 00:04:54.975
I had to start saying no to
things in the Try Guys videos.

00:04:54.975 --> 00:04:56.302
